{"book":"psalms","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:27:29.907323385Z","verse":12,"ref":"psalms 59:12","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":59,"translation":"Do not slay them, lest my people forget. Make them wander by Your strength, and bring them down, O Adonai our shield.","tokens":[{"surface":"אל","gloss":"Do not"},{"surface":"תהרגם","gloss":"slay them"},{"surface":"פן","gloss":"lest"},{"surface":"ישכחו","gloss":"forget"},{"surface":"עמי","gloss":"my people"},{"surface":"הניעמו","gloss":"Make them wander"},{"surface":"בחילך","gloss":"by your strength"},{"surface":"והורידמו","gloss":"and bring them down"},{"surface":"מגננו","gloss":"our shield"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"O Adonai"}]}